      "description": "Implement importable begin/finish helpers and the version-1 record contract with all twelve required fields at their exact types in `controllers/farmboy/scripts/python/metrics.py`, preserving these field constraints from `specs/022-local-workflow-agent-timing-metrics/data-model.md`: `schema_version` \u201cExactly `1`; booleans are not integers for validation.\u201d; `invocation_id` \u201cNonempty opaque turn identity; collector produces UUIDs, report does not reinterpret it as a child ID.\u201d; `run_id` \u201cNonempty opaque metrics correlation identity for one workflow invocation, retained across probes and modeled turns; independent of recovery identity.\u201d; `step_id` \u201cExact modeled ID; `preflight` for probes.\u201d; `invocation_kind` \u201c`execution`, `continuation`, `retry`, `probe`.\u201d; `agent_name` \u201cExact supplied native dispatch name.\u201d; `skill_id` \u201cExact invoking FarmBoy skill ID.\u201d; `workflow_id` \u201cExact invoking installed FarmBoy workflow ID.\u201d; `project_label` \u201cKnown nonpersonal logical identity or `unspecified`; grouping label, not repository identity.\u201d; `started_at` and `finished_at` \u201cValid UTC timestamp `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.mmmZ`.\u201d; `duration_ms` \u201cSigned difference of timestamp epoch milliseconds; reject booleans, fractions and mismatched arithmetic.\u201d; `model` \u201cExplicit `model` in the uniquely matching project agent TOML file; optional, absent normalizes to null.\u201d; and `effort` \u201cExplicit `model_reasoning_effort` in that file; optional, absent normalizes to null.\u201d Also implement millisecond wall-clock sampling, invocation UUID creation, UTC timestamp formatting, JSON stdin/stdout interface, serialization, and public validation helpers; require a UTF-8 JSON object no larger than 65,536 bytes with no duplicate keys or nonfinite numeric constants, and reject projected strings over 32,767 characters or containing illegal XML characters without trimming or truncation (depends on T005).",
